==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Tackey]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can easily cheese this stage by simply killing the first Doge Dark with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] and spawning [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to destroy the base before any threatening enemies spawn, since every enemy is on a timer.

Bring [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]] as your damage dealers. These three will serve as your main [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]]. You should bring [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|dual]] [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Erasers]], or one Eraser and [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono CC]]. Stall/chip down the Dark Otters with your [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] and Pizza Cat and Assassin BearCat until you have enough to level up the [[Worker Cat]] twice, then save money and prepare to lure all the enemies to your base. Try to avoid bringing [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] unless they are able to outrange Tackey and/or can tank hits from it.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Theatre of Fear]] stages, Payday the 13th is named after a horror movie, in this case ''[[wikipedia:Friday the 13th (1980 film)|Friday the 13th]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 4,500. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

